# Trained model artifacts

This directory is intentionally tracked but empty. Persisted model files
(`.pkl`, `.joblib`, `.h5`, `.onnx`, `.pt`, etc.) are excluded by `.gitignore`
because they are large, regenerable, and often platform-specific.

A future trained model is required to live in `apps/ai-service/`
(see `apps/ai-service/app/main.py`) before the production deployment can
return real predictions. Until then, the service responds with
`status: "model_unavailable"` rather than fabricating output.

To promote a model from `ai_models/trained_models/` into a deployable
artifact, export to ONNX and load it at startup in
`apps/ai-service/app/main.py::lifespan`.
